#: ../../config/options_windows.rst:17
msgid ""
"On Windows, Picard has a pulldown menu listing the various CD drives it has "
"found. Pull down the menu and select the drive you want to use by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../config/options_windows.rst:19
msgid ""
"You can override this setting by clicking on :menuselection:`\"Tools --> "
"Lookup CD...\"` and selecting the desired device from the list of available "
"devices."
msgstr ""
